    </HEAD>
    <BODY TEXT="#000000" BGCOLOR="#FFFFFF">
        <font face="Arial,Geneva,Helvetica">
<p>&nbsp;
<p>
            <center>
                <font size="+2" color=red>
                    Without the Breath of God’s Spirit
                </font>
            </center>
            <blockquote>
                <p>
                Black crows cruise for views<br>
                Of viable corpses and cackle<br>
                Blazing fires flame furiously<br>
                As bodies pop and crackle<br>
                Darkened souls drone as they lie<br>
                Locked in keyless shackles<br>
                Demonic spirits taunt and tempt<br>
                To ensnare and tackle<br>
                They hauntingly hunt for victims<br>
                Who choose to be their jackals<br>
                Their deceptions are as appealing<br>
                As a red delicious apple<br>
                A putrid, perverse pride paralyzes<br>
                Each pure soul evil dapples<br>
                Without the Breath of God’s Spirit<br>
                My soul is seized by evil’s grapple<br>
                <p>
                <p>
                <p>
                <p>
            </blockquote>
